<title>USA: F&amp;M National says oks purchase 100,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>F&amp;M National says oks purchase 100,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>WINCHESTER, Va. 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>F&amp;M National Corp said Wednesday it has authorized the purchase of up to 100,000 shares of its common stock on the open market.</p>
<p>The company said it has not yet determined how many, if any, shares it might purchase, but it said it expects any repurchased shares will be used primarily for general corporate purposes, including the funding of employee benefit plans.</p>
</text>
